,0.6741,0.0361,0.0289]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/xinyan/261111-225430/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Redhorn Stonethresher","text":"High CD and DEF improve Physical DPS builds."},{"name":"Skyward Pride","text":"Energy Recharge helps costly Bursts, and vacuum blades benefit from Physical DMG bonuses during on-field attacks. Use Burst before on-field attacks."},{"name":"The Unforged","text":"High ATK potential when shielded."},{"name":"Song of Broken Pines","text":"Physical DMG and an attack-speed team buff suit on-field Physical combos, though passive uptime varies. On-field Physical DPS."},{"name":"Wolf's Gravestone","text":"Strong ATK stat stick and occasional party ATK buff; valuable if you can meet Energy needs elsewhere. ATK buffs can dilute its relative value."},{"name":"Serpent Spine","text":"CRIT Rate and stacking damage bonus are excellent with reliable protection, but its passive increases damage taken. Maintain stacks; protective teammates recommended. R5 is especially strong."},{"name":"Prototype Archaic","text":"Accessible ATK claymore with an extra hit on Normal/Charged Attacks; a straightforward Physical DPS fallback. General on-field DPS."},{"name":"Snow-Tombed Starsilver","text":"Physical DMG substat supports this build, but its icicle passive is inconsistent and often weaker than alternatives. Physical DPS; not automatically best against Cryo."}],"a":[{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"Reliable unconditional 50% Physical DMG; best all-purpose choice without shield/pulse requirements.","stats":"ATK% / Physical DMG / CRIT"},{"names":["Pale Flame"],"text":"Can slightly outperform 2+2 when Skill hits sustain two stacks; unreliable when the shield lacks Pyro pulses.","stats":"ATK% / Physical DMG / CRIT"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Bloodstained Chivalry"],"text":"For C2+ quickswap Burst damage rather than on-field Normal/Charged Attack damage.","stats":"ER or ATK% / Physical DMG / CRIT DMG"}],"t":[{"name":"Rockstar Superconduct","members":["Xinyan","Fischl","Rosaria","Bennett"],"text":"Fischl and Rosaria trigger Superconduct for Physical RES shred. Bennett buffs attacks and heals; Xinyan drives with Physical hits.","roles":["Shielder / Physical Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS / CRIT Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Thunderous Encore","members":["Xinyan","Raiden Shogun","Rosaria","Bennett"],"text":"Raiden and Rosaria enable Superconduct. Raiden restores energy and covers downtime; Bennett amplifies Xinyan’s damage.","roles":["Shielder / Physical Buffer","On-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS / CRIT Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Rebel Shield Crew","members":["Xinyan","Eula","Raiden Shogun","Mika"],"text":"Shield-support Xinyan boosts Physical damage and at C4 shreds Physical RES. Eula carries; Raiden and Mika support her.","roles":["Shielder / Physical Buffer","On-field DPS","On-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Physical Buffer"]},{"name":"Pyro Mosh Pit","members":["Xinyan","Bennett","Xiangling","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Requires Bennett C6 for Pyro-infused attacks. Xiangling adds off-field Pyro while Kazuha buffs Pyro and shreds resistance.","roles":["Shielder / Physical Buffer","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","Buffer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"C2 Burst Nuke: 4pc Emblem, Physical Goblet, CRIT DMG focus; C2 guarantees only the Physical Burst hit CRITs.\nShield Support: 4pc Tenacity, Sacrificial Greatsword; build DEF and enough ER. Shield is conditional and can break.\nC6 Pyro DPS: With Bennett C6, use Pyro Goblet and 4pc Crimson Witch; focus on Charged Attacks.\nBudget Physical: 2pc Pale Flame + 2pc Bloodstained, Prototype Archaic; ATK% / Physical / CRIT.\nC6 Spin DPS: Physical Charged Attack playstyle; DEF% Sands is an optional defensive tradeoff, not universally best.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS / Shield Support"],"about":"Xinyan is a Physical Claymore DPS who uses her shield to boost Physical damage and her Burst for a powerful hit. Superconduct helps her attacks, while C2 guarantees the Physical Burst hit CRITs. She can also shield Physical carries or play Pyro DPS with C6 Bennett, but her shield is fragile without DEF investment.","pros":["Powerful Physical Burst","Superconduct synergy","Flexible DPS or shield role","C2 guaranteed Burst CRIT"],"cons":["Fragile low-DEF shield","Split ATK / DEF scaling","High Burst Energy needs","Needs careful team setup"],"weapons":["Redhorn Stonethresher","Skyward Pride","The Unforged","Song of Broken Pines","Wolf's Gravestone","Serpent Spine","Prototype Archaic","Snow-Tombed Starsilver"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Pale Flame"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Bloodstained Chivalry"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Shielder"}],"main":["ATK% / Energy Recharge","Physical DMG","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["Energy Recharge: 160% - 190% (double Pyro)","Energy Recharge: 200% - 230%+ (solo Pyro)","Energy Recharge: 130% - 150%+ (solo Pyro + Raiden)","Crit Rate: 60% - 75% (on-field)","Crit DMG: 120% - 180%+ (gear dependent)"],"vars":[{"title":"C2+ Physical Burst Nuke","role":"Quickswap Burst DPS","weapons":["Redhorn Stonethresher","Skyward Pride","Luxurious Sea-Lord","Akuoumaru"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Pale Flame","Bloodstained Chivalry"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"Physical Goblet; emphasize CRIT DMG, ATK and enough ER; Burst Physical hit auto-CRITs at C2.","teams":"Physical buffers, Superconduct if possible, and adequate particles.","when":"Swap in for Skill then Burst; maximize the upfront Physical strike, rather than long on-field strings.","cond":"C2+ for guaranteed Physical Burst CRIT","notes":"Only the Physical Burst hit gets the guaranteed CRIT; other attacks still use normal CRIT Rate.","pre":false},{"title":"DEF Shield Support","role":"Shield / Physical Buffer","weapons":["Sacrificial Greatsword","Favonius Greatsword","Whitebli